        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "Zeta potential measurements were carried out on pulverized samples suspended in electrolytic solutions (0.01 wt.%) using a Zeta Sizer 3 (Malvern Instruments, Malvern, Worcestershire, UK). The velocity of the particles in an electric field of 100 V was measured by Laser Doppler Anemometry using a He/Ne laser beam. The simple Smoluchowski equation which allows to calculate zeta potential values from the electrophoretic mobilities - was used:"
